                                                "sense_id": "cbdca92b-cfa4-338b-86c6-4395bd02f220",
                                                "text": "A sonatina usually has 2 or 3 rather short movements. While these movements provide contrasts of tempo and mood, they also complement one another, combining to fulfill the overall plan for a complete work in several parts."
                                            }
